{
  "_about": [
    "The trend arrow, one decision per platform (Android graph/CardModel.kt TrendAngle, Mac SukraraGraph TrendAngle):",
    "rate (mg/dL/min) -> the text arrow every text place writes (alert title, Live Update notification title, Mac menu bar,",
    "Mac alert title: GlucoseLook.arrowText / TrendAngle.symbol) and the drawn arrow's angle (deg, y-down canvas: negative",
    "= up; +-3 = straight up / down) and whether it's doubled. No rate = the 'no trend' ring. Text places never map a rate",
    "themselves: the cross-surface tests (Android TrendFixtureTest + LiveNotificationContentTest + AlertNotifierTest, Mac",
    "GraphTests TrendFixtureTests + AppTests MenubarTitleTests) assert every place against these cases.",
    "The text bands (Nightscout's +-1 / 2 / 3) are not where the drawn arrow starts to tilt (it rotates continuously):",
    "-0.6 draws 18 deg down while the text says steady. Changing that is an owner decision (OPS issues fx-arrow)."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "rate +5",
      "rate": 5.0,
      "expect": {
        "text": "⇈",
        "deg": -90.0,
        "double": true
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "rate +3",
      "rate": 3.0,
      "expect": {
        "text": "⇈",
        "deg": -90.0,
        "double": true
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "rate +2.9",
      "rate": 2.9,
      "expect": {
        "text": "↑",
        "deg": -87.0,
        "double": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "rate +2",
      "rate": 2.0,
      "expect": {
        "text": "↑",
        "deg": -60.0,
        "double": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "rate +1.99",
      "rate": 1.99,
      "expect": {
        "text": "↗",
        "deg": -59.7,
        "double": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "rate +1.5",
      "rate": 1.5,
      "expect": {
        "text": "↗",
        "deg": -45.0,
        "double": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "rate +1",
      "rate": 1.0,
      "expect": {
        "text": "↗",
        "deg": -30.0,
        "double": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "rate +0.99",
      "rate": 0.99,
      "expect": {
        "text": "→",
        "deg": -29.7,
        "double": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "rate +0",
      "rate": 0.0,
      "expect": {
        "text": "→",
        "deg": 0.0,
        "double": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "rate -0.6",
      "rate": -0.6,
      "expect": {
        "text": "→",
        "deg": 18.0,
        "double": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "rate -0.99",
      "rate": -0.99,
      "expect": {
        "text": "→",
        "deg": 29.7,
        "double": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "rate -1",
      "rate": -1.0,
      "expect": {
        "text": "↘",
        "deg": 30.0,
        "double": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "rate -1.5",
      "rate": -1.5,
      "expect": {
        "text": "↘",
        "deg": 45.0,
        "double": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "rate -1.99",
      "rate": -1.99,
      "expect": {
        "text": "↘",
        "deg": 59.7,
        "double": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "rate -2",
      "rate": -2.0,
      "expect": {
        "text": "↓",
        "deg": 60.0,
        "double": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "rate -2.9",
      "rate": -2.9,
      "expect": {
        "text": "↓",
        "deg": 87.0,
        "double": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "rate -3",
      "rate": -3.0,
      "expect": {
        "text": "⇊",
        "deg": 90.0,
        "double": true
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "rate -5",
      "rate": -5.0,
      "expect": {
        "text": "⇊",
        "deg": 90.0,
        "double": true
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "no rate",
      "rate": null,
      "expect": {
